/* zh-Hant translations of App/Info.plist strings (the English text lives in project.yml). Voice input (the mic
   button) asks for these two on its first tap; speech is recognised on the iPhone only. Only the app's Info.plist
   declares them, so the extensions, which share this folder, never use them. This folder also makes XcodeGen list
   zh-Hant in the project's knownRegions, so keep the file. */
"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "點麥克風就能用說的輸入計畫，不用打字。語音會在這支 iPhone 上轉成文字，不會錄音存檔，也不會傳送到任何地方。";
"NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription" = "你說的話會在這支 iPhone 上轉成文字，讓你用說的輸入計畫。語音不會錄音存檔，也不會傳送到任何地方。";
